      "deck": "The same frontend, three engines: a 100,000-row virtualized table scrolled by script, 100,000 particles on Canvas 2D, and a 16-octave noise shader on WebGL2, each 600 frames after 60 warmup frames. Frame time is vsync-capped at 59 Hz so the tail and the main-thread step time carry the signal; the chart is step time per frame pooled over the three tests.",
